      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "vtLR1",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Cl</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> is more reactive than <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>ClF</mi><mo>.</mo></math>",
