      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> is more reactive than <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>ClF</mi><mo>.</mo></math>",
